"P2022843722" "Clear away the IDF defenders blocking your access to the TPN Campus main building.<br><br>As you do so, H.D. will become increasingly interested in your exploits and will begin dispatching his cameras to get some footage of the action.<br><br>Defeat enough of the defenders without destroying the cameras and H.D. will invite you into the main building so that your message can be broadcast!"
