// Generic String :
"P2063834979" "<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>Good evening, Praetoria. Here is Breaking News from the Total Praetoria Network, where IDF have taken up positions around TPN's own campus!<t=5 x=0.15 y=0.35 d=10><scale 1.75><color CornflowerBlue><bgcolor Black>Good evening, $name. Has anyone told you how great you are for ratings? You've got one of those faces.<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>The IDF believes invaders are attacking TPN to broadcast anti-Cole propaganda! TPN is attempting to verify these claims.<t=5 x=0.15 y=0.35 d=10><scale 1.75><color CornflowerBlue><bgcolor Black>So here's a limited time offer: Access to my broadcast stations... IF you put on a good show for the cameras! Win-Win.<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>A PPD curfew is in effect for Logos or Aureas. Citizens are advised to stay away.<t=5 x=0.15 y=0.35 d=10><scale 1.75><color CornflowerBlue><bgcolor Black>Destruction of my cameras has been known to cause hair loss, chest discomfort and loss of my favor. Don't do it!"
// Generic String :
"P2883858675" "HD Sends a Camera to Cover Your Assault!"
// Generic String :
