"P397631154" "Favorability:"
// Generic String :
"P2737957419" "Initiate the Broadcast"
// Generic String :
"P1506560704" "Enter the Main Building of TPN Campus. H.D. will help you broadcast to the citizens of Praetoria and build Public Opinion by using terminals in his main room.<br><br>The IDF will send Technicians to lock down these terminals and slowly deplete your public opinion. These Technicians must be defeated before a terminal will unlock, but they are shielded by the presence of nearby IDF. Defeat the IDF and then the Technician at a terminal to be able to use it.<br><br>After the fourth terminal is completed, Maelstrom will arrive. Defeat him while preventing the returning IDF from depleting Public Opinion to complete the stage."
