// Generic String :
"P3056314296" "<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>An update on the developments at TPN Campus: The invaders have breached the main broadcast facilities.<t=5 x=0.15 y=0.35 d=10><scale 1.75><color CornflowerBlue><bgcolor Black>Mr. H.D. here for TPN. Have you grown tired of the Cole regime? Do you fear for the future of Praetoria? Are buried secrets keeping you up at night?<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>But authorities refuse to release any offical information concerning the assault on TPN.<t=5 x=0.15 y=0.35 d=10><scale 1.75><color CornflowerBlue><bgcolor Black>It is not too late. Simply cast your vote at any of my many broadcast terminals within the main building, and we can begin to spread the truth.<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>TPN shall continue to report as it happens. For your safety, please stay in your homes!<t=5 x=0.15 y=0.35 d=10><scale 1.75><color CornflowerBlue><bgcolor Black>Put your trust in H.D., and together we'll build the future of Praetoria. Paid for by Friends of H.D."
