"P129548421" "H.D. opens all three buildings of TPN Campus for you now, allowing more opportunities to strengthen your broadcast. The IDF and their Technicians will continue to try to stop you.<br><br>However, in this stage, the citizens of Praetoria have come to watch the events unfold. Mother Mayhem, however, dispatches special Seers called Telepathists to Mindwash the accumulated citizens. When Mindwashed, citizens will attack. Any conversion or defeat of a citizen depletes Public Opinion, so be sure to keep the Telepathists under control!<br><br>Once 500 Public Opinion is accumulated and maintained for 30 seconds, Maelstrom will return to face you."
// Generic String :
