"P823827745" "Next Phase in:"
// Generic String :
"P311646623" "<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>We apologize for the technical difficulties during this evening's broadcast.<t=5 x=0.15 y=0.35 d=10><scale 1.75><color CornflowerBlue><bgcolor Black>What do you see? Do you see a world of possibility? I certainly do. All around, there are so many people waiting to be swayed by the message.<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>It appears that the IDF and the invaders are fighting over TPN's broadcast signal.<t=5 x=0.15 y=0.35 d=10><scale 1.75><color CornflowerBlue><bgcolor Black>The Emperor has his message and you have yours. He will send Seers to sway the public, but you can use the best in class features provided by H.D.<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>What the invaders are attempting to broadcast remains unclear at this time.<t=5 x=0.15 y=0.35 d=10><scale 1.75><color CornflowerBlue><bgcolor Black>H.D. will see to it that your message is delivered in style, but only if you head down to your local TPN showroom and keep the technicians from taking away your chance at luxury!"
// Generic String :
"P1927465235" "Public Opinion Threshold Reached! Maintain for 30s!"
// Generic String :
"P4154764513" "Public Opinion Threshold Lost!"
// Generic String :
"P1994458050" "<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>In the last few minutes, some new information has come to light. The first broadcasts from the invaders are coming in....<t=5 x=0.15 y=0.35 d=10><scale 1.75><color CornflowerBlue><bgcolor Black>Maelstrom. You've seen him before. He's tough. He's arrogant. And now he's come back to ruin your fun!<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>Wait. This can't be right. Have we checked this?<t=5 x=0.15 y=0.35 d=10><scale 1.75><color CornflowerBlue><bgcolor Black>Don't let this happen to you! Nothing works better at repelling pests and Maelstrom than some quick action and tough love. You'll be amazed by the results you can achieve with just a few applications!<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>Ladies and gentlemen, in all my years bringing you the news, I have never seen a story like this... we're still verifying the details, but there is emerging evidence of a scandal which would rock the Emperor's regime....<t=5 x=0.15 y=0.35 d=10><scale 1.75><color CornflowerBlue><bgcolor Black>Don't forget, though, that Maelstrom can be stubborn. For those extra hard cases of Maelstrom, be sure to apply some extra pressure. He'll get the hint, and you'll be Maelstrom free in no time!"
// Generic String :
"P4192607708" "Public Opinion Victory!"
// Generic String :
"P1461558426" "Maelstrom Returns and Settles the Citizenry!"
// Generic String :
"P4190649898" "Maelstrom's reinforcements arrive!"
// Generic String :
"P4117386425" "<color #999999><bgcolor #340F12>Fools! Do you really think you're changing anything? The Emperor will not stand idly by and allow his people to be destroyed. We will stop this... I will stop this!"
// Generic String :
"P2637769130" "<t=8 x=0.4 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color #999999><bgcolor #340F12>Fools! Do you really think you're changing anything? The Emperor will not stand idly by and allow his people to be destroyed. We will stop this... I will stop this!"
// Generic String :
"P2767851406" "<color #999999><bgcolor #340F12>We are trying to keep Praetoria safe! Have you even thought this through? Are you prepared to do what needs to be done to keep the people safe?!"
// Generic String :
