"P852461006" "Maelstrom will now remain present throughout the stage. His presence calms the citizenry and continuously depletes Public Opinion. However, he can be chased away from the field for 30 seconds if his health is dropped enough.<br><br>As before, Citizens, Telepathists and Technicians must be managed and the TPN Campus terminals used in order to accumulate the needed Public Opinion.<br><br>The goal is to achieve 500 Public Opinion and maintain it for 30 seconds, at which point Maelstrom will face the league in a final confrontation."
