// Generic String :
"P747004624" "<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>We are receiving confirmation now. Emperor Cole did NOT defeat the Hamidon as we have been told.<t=5 x=0.15 y=0.35 d=10><scale 1.75><color CornflowerBlue><bgcolor Black>This is it, the main event! Tonight, in Imperial City! One night only! It's the Incarnates vs. the Imperials in a showdown!<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>Our leadership instead negotiated a peace, a peace that left the Hamidon able to one day wage war on us again.<t=5 x=0.15 y=0.35 d=10><scale 1.75><color CornflowerBlue><bgcolor Black>Watch in amazement as the IDF deploy even more forces to try and cut off the broadcast! Watch as the Incarnates strike back harder than ever before! You've never seen anything like this!<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>Now, because of this war, the Hamidon has decided that our Emperor has broken his agreement, and readies itself to assault humanity once more!<t=5 x=0.15 y=0.35 d=10><scale 1.75><color CornflowerBlue><bgcolor Black>Hurry down to TPN Campus in Imperial City! This is the event everyone in Praetoria will be talking about tomorrow! Don't miss it!"
// Generic String :
"P3777687151" "Maelstrom Issues A Challenge!"
// Generic String :
"P912687098" "Maelstrom Returns and Issues A Challenge!"
// Generic String :
"P3878851092" "<color #999999><bgcolor #340F12>You may think you've won. You may think you're doing what's right. But, I assure you, that is not the case!"
// Generic String :
"P3531929721" "<t=8 x=0.4 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color #999999><bgcolor #340F12>You may think you've won. You may think you're doing what's right. But, I assure you, that is not the case!"
// Generic String :
"P491036851" "<color #999999><bgcolor #340F12>Emperor Cole has always worked for the good of Praetoria! Ask yourselves if you are doing the same! How will you see to it the people are protected?!"
// Generic String :
"P3079529530" "<t=8 x=0.4 y=0.2 d=8><scale 1.75><color #999999><bgcolor #340F12>Emperor Cole has always worked for the good of Praetoria! Ask yourselves if you are doing the same! How will you see to it the people are protected?!"
// Generic String :
"P2179912584" "<color #999999><bgcolor #340F12>This is not over! We will always fight on behalf of the people of Praetoria! You will be stopped!"
// Generic String :
