"P279818077" "<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>Tonight has proven to be one of the darkest days since the founding of Praetoria.<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>Ladies and gentlemen, we are betrayed. We placed our faith in a man... a man who could protect us.<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>We lived peacefully, even as the Hamidon still rumbles distantly beyond the fences, secure because our Emperor could destroy it.<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>Tonight, however, we have learned that Emperor Cole does not have the strength to keep us safe.<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>The Emperor could not defeat a creature bent on destroying our world, so instead he negotiated a truce with it... on its terms. And now, through the current war, that truce is broken.<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>Because of this, we are all under threat. I, for one, call on the Emperor to explain his actions.<t=9 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=10><scale 1.75><color Burlywood><bgcolor Black>Should he fail to do so, this anchor suggests we have no choice... but to support those who may be able to free this world from the Hamidon once and for all!"
